    "text": "By Mark Fischer ,\n1 days ago LINCOLN, Neb. (KLKN) — Governor Jim Pillen on Tuesday signed a new executive order to aid in the delivery of wildfire supplies. The reissued order aims to facilitate additional deliveries of feed and supplies to farmers and ranchers in areas devastated by recent wildfires. According to Pillen, the order... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
